            "text": "<strong>Design-Led Everyday Crossbody</br></strong>UL5 is a 230 g, 2.8L X-Pac crossbody bag built around a sculpted cylinder silhouette, and a magnetic flapand. It carries a focused set of everyday essentials while remaining a visible part of the wearer’s city style.",
