          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "award",
            "heading": "Features",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Sculpted Cylinder Shape</strong><br/>A distinctive cylinder crossbody bag that creates a clear, dimensional profile on the body.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Everyday Carry</strong><br/>At 230g, UL5 feels easy to wear from morning coffee to evening plans.</li><li><strong>2.8L Daily Essentials Storage</strong><br/>Designed for phone, wallet, earbuds, keys, sunglasses and compact personal items.</li><li><strong>X-Pac Structured Shell</strong><br/>X-Pac material adds crisp structure, tactile texture and everyday waterproof.</li><li><strong>Magnetic Flap Access</strong><br/>A one-hand magnetic flap opens smoothly and closes with a satisfying snap.</li><li><strong>Side Quick-Access Pocket</strong><br/>Keeps high-frequency items like keys, earbuds and cards separate and easy to reach.</li><li><strong>Organized Personal Storage</strong><br/>Internal pockets, including a zipper pocket and AirTag pocket, keep small essentials in place.</li><li><strong>Three City-Ready Colors</strong><br/>Carbon Black, Graphite and Olive give UL5 different moods for daily city styling.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_j8pCA6": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "swatchbook",
            "heading": "Materials",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Outer Fabric:</strong> <br/>Dimension-Polyant X-Pac X21 / X42 three-layer composite material</li><li><strong>Lining:</strong> <br/>230T twill polyester fiber</li><li><strong>Weather Resistance:</strong> <br/>The fabric is waterproof.However, because the entire bag is made using a stitching technique, it is not completely waterproof, but it can withstand daily light rain and minor splashes.</li><li><strong>Back Panel:</strong> <br/>Breathable 3D mesh back panel</li><li><strong>Fasteners:</strong> Frosted zinc alloy</li><li><strong>Zipper:</strong> SBS waterproof zipper</li><li><strong>Webbing:</strong> Polyester jacquard webbing</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
